description=[b]✓ Fully compatible with Build 42.12.3 (SP) and 42.13+ (MP)[/b][br][br]Collect all nearby liquids into a target container with one action. No more tedious right-clicking![br][br]I love B42's liquid transfer system, but the clicking gets tedious fast - rain fills cups faster than I can pour them into a pot! This isn't cheating, it's just automation. I want to play the game, not play "pour simulator".[br][br]Sure, you can have a 150L rain collector... but what if you're starting "Winter is Coming" challenge with one saucepan and 3 cups? Oh boy, you have some right-clicking in front of you! :)[br][br]This mod automatically adapts to your game version - works in both singleplayer and multiplayer!
